Let me write the algorithm precisely.

**Chunk writing:**
```
void WriteChunk(Stream s, string type, ReadOnlySpan<byte> data):
    WriteUInt32BE(s, data.Length);
    s.Write(Encoding.ASCII.GetBytes(type)); // or write 4 bytes
    s.Write(data);
    // CRC over type + data
    uint crc = Crc32 to compute over (type bytes + data);
    WriteUInt32BE(s, crc);
```

